      "text": "one God and one Shepherd over all, 1 Ne. 13:41. the Holy One numbers his sheep, and they know him, 1 Ne. 22:25 (3 Ne. 18:31). he who will hear my voice will be my sheep, Mosiah 26:21. the Good Shepherd calls you in his own name, Alma 5:38–39. he who desires to follow the Good Shepherd should come out from wicked, Alma 5:57. Nephites will not hearken to voice of the Good Shepherd, Hel. 7:18. Lamanites to be brought to knowledge of the Redeemer, great and true Shepherd, Hel. 15:13. one fold and one shepherd, 3 Ne. 15:21 (16:3). Nephites once had Christ for their shepherd, Morm. 5:17.",
